$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General Procedure (GP 3) for Palladium-Catalyzed Stille Coupling of
(S,S)-7 and rac-8. Under argon, (S,S)-7 (96 mg, 0.2 mmol) or rac-8 (100
mg, 0.3 mmol), Pd2(dba)3 (1 mol %), and rac-BINAP (2.2 mol %) were
dissolved in toluene (2 mL). After addition of the stannane (1.2 equiv),
the mixture was heated to reflux until the starting material was
completely consumed (TLC analysis). The solution was concentrated in
vacuo, and the resulting product was isolated by column chromatography
(SiO2). Synthesis of (S,S)-12a. Following GP 3 using (S,S)-7 and
tributyl(vinyl)tin gave 86.4 mg (97%) of (S,S)-12a as a white solid and
as a single isomer: mp 153-154 °C; [α]D -41.42 (c 1.26, MeOH); 1H NMR
(CDCl3, 400 MHz) δ 7.78 (d, 2H, J = 8.2 Hz), 7.56 (d, 2H, J = 8.5 Hz),
7.29-7.20 (m, 5H), 6.76 (dd, 1H, J = 11.0, 17.6 Hz), 5.92 (d, 1H, J =
17.6 Hz), 5.48 (d, 1H, J = 11.0 Hz), 5.16 (d, 1H, J = 7.4 Hz), 4.61-4.56
(m, 1H), 3.33 (s, 3H), 3.25-3.08 (m, 2H), 1.41(s, 9H); 13C NMR (CDCl3,
100 MHz) δ 179.9, 155.3, 143.2, 137.2, 136.9, 135.0, 129.7, 128.2, 127.5,
127.1, 126.5, 118.4, 79.2, 57.4, 44.1, 38.6, 28.4; IR (neat, cm-1) 3384,
2930, 1623, 1525; MS (CI, m/z) 429 (MH+). Anal. Calcd for C23H28N2O4S: C,
64.46; H, 6.59; N, 6.54. Found: C, 64.33; H, 6.70; N, 6.48.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Synthesis and palladium-catalyzed coupling reactions of enantiopure
p-bromophenyl methyl sulfoximine
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Cho, Gae Young; Okamura, Hiroaki; Bolm, Carsten
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Organic Chemistry (2005), 70(6), 2346-2349

